      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-06-15T12:20:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was thinking about it. But it is the only function that requires this logic, since the commands versions are handled internally in the API. If you say that it would be better, I will move this to upstream and make a function call.",
      "parentUuid": "2061377b_05ed13d0",
