      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-06-15T20:25:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the right approach for now is to create two versions of `EC_CMD_GET_CMD_VERSIONS`.  The legacy one lives here, and is #ifdef\u0027d out when `CONFIG_ZEPHYR \u0026\u0026 CONFIG_EC_HOST_CMD`.\n\nThe version supporting `CONFIG_ZEPHYR \u0026\u0026 CONFIG_EC_HOST_CMD` should get moved into zephyr/shim/src/host_commands.c.  It could also directly register itself using `EC_HOST_CMD_HANDLER` instead of the `DECLARE_HOST_COMMAND`.",
      "parentUuid": "8a12014a_9337e7cd",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 558,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 581,
        "endChar": 0
