      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-06-15T20:25:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was hopeful that most legacy commands had some bounds checks, which could then be removed by using `EC_HOST_CMD_HANDLER`.  But I found only a few cases.\n\nSo, it doesn\u0027t appear worth the effort to support `EC_HOST_CMD_HANDLER` with the legacy commands.",
